{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106125","id":2501895155,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6VH-Pz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106125","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106125.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106125.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106125","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106125/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106125/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106125/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aa1f5ffe8321bc57155f606197b5aa93dd9e662c","number":106125,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[.NET] Add web export support","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Use Mono embedding APIs statically linked to load the Mono WASM runtime.\r\n\r\n- The Mono runtime is fetched using the `GetRuntimePack` C# project. It needs the `wasm-tools` workload.\r\n- The `GetRuntimePack` defines stub functions for all the function pointers we need to retrieve from C#, so the `PInvokeTableGenerator` includes them in the generated `pinvoke-table.h` file.\r\n- Globalization doesn't work, so for now we're always enabling [invariant mode](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/runtime-config/globalization#invariant-mode).\r\n- The Mono runtime uses stubs for their exported JavaScript functions, these need to be replaced with the real implementation in their `dotnet.runtime.js` module but we don't have an easy way to do that yet, which means some BCL APIs will not work (i.e.: crypto APIs)\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/70796\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n> This is still a work in progress, but it should be possible to export a C# game to web with some manual changes to the exported `.js` afterwards.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis PR was tested with the demo project: [Web .NET prototype](https://github.com/raulsntos/godot4-web-dotnet-prototype)\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> The demo project requires multi-threading, so make sure to change the `<WasmEnableThreads>` property to `true` to use the right Mono runtime.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":29